cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "One Image to 3D Scene"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Iwatsuki
    given-names: Masami
repository-code: "https://github.com/IWATSUKI-Masami/one-image-to-3d-scene"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A web app that reconstructs a 3D scene from a single monocular RGB image with an
  object-based approach: each object is detected, its hidden parts are completed
  with generative AI while the visible part keeps its place, it is turned into a
  3D model, and the models are placed in 3D space by monocular depth estimation.
keywords:
  - 3D scene reconstruction
  - single image
  - generative AI
  - image completion
  - image-to-3D
  - monocular depth estimation
  - Three.js
